#: e65554d67e0c4dd18204ec181129af26
msgid ""
"The PX4FMU (v1) is end of life and is not generally available for purchase. "
"This article is made available for existing users."
msgstr "PX4FMU（v1）已停产，通常无法购买。本文仅供现有用户参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:14
#: fbbbee4e515048829bb02ada9e08d361
msgid "This page provides an overview of the Pixhawk Flight Management Unit."
msgstr "本页概述 Pixhawk 飞行管理单元（Flight Management Unit）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:17
#: 3a7f7a9b3a2d49fda90d19b074a7a0a3
msgid "Pixhawk (FMUv2) and PX4FMU (FMUv1)"
msgstr "Pixhawk（FMUv2）与 PX4FMU（FMUv1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:19
#: 19d2b578ad654d15ac490ffeceed6c2b
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk (FMUv2) single board autopilot evolved from the original \"PX4 "
"system\", which consists of the PX4FMU and various piggyback boards "
"including the PX4IO and PX4IOAR."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk（FMUv2）单板飞控由最初的「PX4 系统」演化而来，该系统由 PX4FMU 及多种扩展板（包括 PX4IO 和 PX4IOAR）组成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:22
#: 16878a458d444c18a511365c0b3f931c
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk incorporates several additional features to provide extended "
"capabilities for our ArduPilot flight system."
msgstr "Pixhawk 集成了多项附加功能，为 ArduPilot 飞行系统提供了扩展能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:25
#: d03e0248121745b6a1b14787e2f2849f
msgid ""
"A connector diagram of the Pixhawk is shown below, but :ref:`Go to this link"
" for full information on the Pixhawk <common-pixhawk-overview>`"
msgstr ""
"下图为 Pixhawk 的接口示意图，:ref:`点击此链接查看 Pixhawk 完整信息 <common-pixhawk-overview>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:28
#: d5a2f730ea5a49f6b137f04ed30f80ad
msgid "The PX4FMU/PX4IO (FMUv1) Flight Management System Includes:"
msgstr "PX4FMU/PX4IO（FMUv1）飞行管理系统包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:30
#: 206ebb14aab142dba65c439a86437979
msgid "**The PX4-FMU (Flight Management Unit).**"
msgstr "**PX4-FMU（飞行管理单元）。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:32
#: b89dfca14fc74195a12203ec07669ee2
msgid ""
"A powerful Cortex M4F micro-controller and flash memory for controlling "
"flight and communications."
msgstr "强大的 Cortex M4F 微控制器和闪存，用于飞行控制和通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:34
#: 1c1c2584a2d34b37b63a2ffc11fc1f54
msgid "A socket for a plug in SD memory card."
msgstr "SD 存储卡插槽。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:35
#: b905e47cbe904fd6b3f0ada19dbbc81d
msgid "A 3 axis gyro for determining orientation."
msgstr "用于确定姿态的三轴陀螺仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:36
#: d31fd2d2844a4a0886968b08ca2acb7e
msgid "A 3 axis Accelerometer for determining outside influences."
msgstr "用于检测外部影响的三轴加速度计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:37
#: b1ea405ea0e043be9490b1ae8b97ed10
msgid "A compass (magnetometer)."
msgstr "罗盘（磁力计）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:38
#: 45f1670f564b4a98b6dcab52289c3213
msgid "A barometric pressure sensor for determining altitude."
msgstr "用于测量高度的气压计。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:39
#: 7078d4f19da74d9284348b8ee890e197
msgid ""
"A connection for an externally mountable UBLOX LEA GPS for determining "
"absolute position."
msgstr "外部可安装的 UBLOX LEA GPS 接口，用于确定绝对位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:41
#: 8820f091998e411f9f25d5bf6694de49
msgid "Stackable board interconnections for adding various peripheral boards."
msgstr "可叠加扩展板的堆叠式板间互联接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:43
#: d3e6f0a37ba84d4c857ab21e5969f3db
msgid "Communications interfaces for USB, JTAG and Serial connections."
msgstr "USB、JTAG 和串口通信接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:44
#: ece30f017b6e4edea08a591b1df36c92
msgid "Connections for PPM-SUM RC radio input and servo outputs."
msgstr "PPM-SUM 遥控输入和舵机输出接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:46
#: 41b0e2eeb2cd4824b2902ce0337a2e32
msgid "**The PX4-IO (Input Output) Board.**"
msgstr "**PX4-IO（输入输出）扩展板。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:48
#: 15302129482141f096bff26eae586b4f
msgid "Contains its own on board micro-controller and stacks with the FMU."
msgstr "内置独立微控制器，可与 FMU 叠加安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:49
#: 9ff5bff95784461e8f10615aded56d0c
msgid "Direct battery input power supply."
msgstr "直接电池输入供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:50
#: 77c3559126de4b04b4bb74b8fcd7ecbf
msgid "8 High speed servo PWM outputs."
msgstr "8 路高速舵机 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:51
#: d22c525ac9954084b11191301b15108b
msgid "Futaba SBUS or PPM-SUM serial servo output."
msgstr "Futaba SBUS 或 PPM-SUM 串行舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:52
#: 30b88924aa154ee9a95c123f8f4517b1
msgid "A variety of PPM-SUM / SBUS input connectors."
msgstr "多种 PPM-SUM / SBUS 输入接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:53
#: 004b729143a543f3a810e133c1cce295
msgid ""
"Two user assignable relays, two 1/2 amp 5 volt outputs and an analog input "
"port."
msgstr "两路用户可分配继电器、两路 1/2 安 5V 输出及一路模拟输入端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:56
#: 388db1ddbc45452cb82c4bc2ed34215a
msgid "**The PX4FLOW Smart (Optical Flow) Camera.**"
msgstr "**PX4FLOW 智能光流摄像头。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:58
#: d54d1f20c30a442eadf35140f30d9022
msgid ""
"Specialized downward pointing camera module that uses ground texture and "
"features to determine aircraft motion over the ground."
msgstr "专用向下摄像头模块，通过识别地面纹理和特征来确定飞行器对地运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:60
#: 6d04b3ae68da4452847c69850f025cee
msgid ""
"The PX4FLOW has the same powerful Cortex M4F micro-controller as is used in "
"the PX4FMU."
msgstr "PX4FLOW 使用与 PX4FMU 相同的强大 Cortex M4F 微控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:62
#: 197dfdc8ac564a70bada1ce31e2b9673
msgid ""
"The built in micro-controller performs on board automated binned pixel image"
" analysis to determine motion relative to ground."
msgstr "内置微控制器自动执行像素图像的区块分析，以确定相对于地面的运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:64
#: 5281b73c8c354ea9bc723ecd651c81f6
msgid ""
"A built in 3 axis gyro enables automatic compensation for variance in "
"aircraft tilt angle."
msgstr "内置三轴陀螺仪可自动补偿飞行器倾斜角度变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:67
#: a34201c5d7be4f2f88e505ee75febe8b
msgid ""
"**The PX4-IOAR Quad Carrier is a specialized interface board for the Parrot "
"AR.Drone.**"
msgstr "**PX4-IOAR 四旋翼载板是专为 Parrot AR.Drone 设计的专用接口板。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:70
#: 58b29d4abd79420aab662273fe8c1e2c
msgid ""
"**The PX4FMU circuit board comes preassembled and ready to load the firmware"
" for your airframe using the Mission Planner.**"
msgstr "**PX4FMU 电路板出厂时已预装完毕，可直接通过 Mission Planner 为您的机型加载固件。**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:77
#: 774d2371c4144b49a165c09cf5cd396a
msgid "Detailed Description"
msgstr "详细说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:82
#: 6822eaa676b54f2ea2d8d1741bd560e1
msgid ""
"**The Back of the PX4FMU board showing the SD card carrier and buzzer "
"socket:**"
msgstr "**PX4FMU 板背面，显示 SD 卡槽和蜂鸣器插座：**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:89
#: 3d49e9d6ec77483cbe882a0a22f3f0ac
msgid "PX4FMU Connector diagram"
msgstr "PX4FMU 接口示意图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:95
#: 9e446302e1a944229145ff635c2d83dc
msgid "Analog and digital pins"
msgstr "模拟与数字引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:97
#: f43a5a4667874ee48ca5956ed831daab
msgid ""
"This section lists what pins (analog and digital) are available on the "
"PX4FMU."
msgstr "本节列出 PX4FMU 上可用的引脚（模拟和数字）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:100
#: 960f1a1eed5d47d687240b334abc14ca
msgid "PX4v1 Analog inputs"
msgstr "PX4v1 模拟输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:102
#: 836819ed9625410ca42e3a24f1c8d729
msgid ""
"The PX4FMUv1 has the following “available” Analog input port pins which may "
"be put to a variety of uses."
msgstr "PX4FMUv1 提供以下「可用」模拟输入引脚，可用于多种用途。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:105
#: e17d3f82f2fa4d6fbec5553f7de0dc3a
msgid "**Pin 10** (High voltage analog pin):"
msgstr "**引脚 10** （高电压模拟引脚）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:107
#: 84859a1547ae448f8dec8eba16aeec9b
msgid ""
"FMU battery voltage measured on pin 5 of the 15 pin multi-connector on the "
"end of the FMU board. It has 5.7:1 scaling, allowing it to measure up to "
"18.8V."
msgstr "FMU 电池电压，在 FMU 板末端 15 针多功能连接器的第 5 针测量。缩放比为 5.7:1，可测量最高 18.8V 的电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:110
#: a5bc73cdc22f4dbdaa539f284cc8a129
msgid ""
"Located on pin 5 of the DF13 15 pin \"multi-connector\" of the PX4FMU board."
msgstr "位于 PX4FMU 板 DF13 15 针「多功能连接器」的第 5 针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:112
#: e41b2a150c3042d8a625629f3fb18ba2
msgid ""
"This pin can accept up to 18.6 volts. (You can add an additional resistor "
"divider and set the scaling appropriately for higher voltages)."
msgstr "此引脚最高可承受 18.6V（您可以添加分压电阻并相应调整缩放比以支持更高电压）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:115
#: a7b630a85f714004a3118cf230b8faa4
msgid ""
"With the Advanced Parameter VOLT_DIVIDER set to 1 voltage can be read "
"directly."
msgstr "将高级参数 VOLT_DIVIDER 设为 1 后，可直接读取电压值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:118
#: 3ca87e0582574bbeae97814a6f751621
msgid ""
"For old releases VOLT_DIVIDER needed to be set to 5.66 for direct voltage "
"scaling."
msgstr "在旧版本中，需将 VOLT_DIVIDER 设为 5.66 才能直接缩放电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:121
#: 863a88719337499584c1f9293057ca40
msgid "**Pin 11** (Analog airspeed input pin)"
msgstr "**引脚 11** （模拟空速输入引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:123
#: ead209c1a0b64cbe875c050256f67ed8
msgid ""
"Located on pin 2 of the 3 pin \"FMU-PRS\" DF13 connector on the PX4IO board."
msgstr "位于 PX4IO 板上 3 针「FMU-PRS」DF13 连接器的第 2 针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:125
#: 4f5ad4f4facc4d2b9a811e4f4bb25d79
msgid ""
"Generally used in Plane for the Air Speed Sensor with VCC on pin 1, Sensor "
"on pin 2 and Ground on pin 3."
msgstr "通常在 Plane 中用于空速传感器，第 1 针为 VCC，第 2 针为传感器信号，第 3 针为地线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:128
#: b8d7ca7f7adc48e093ad850815a42071
msgid "Plane Advanced Parameter: ASPD_PIN set to 11."
msgstr "Plane 高级参数：ASPD_PIN 设为 11。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:130
#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:141
#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:151
#: 363048acb35b48a9a47097429d03690a 747b5e203ec24b1683c25cfc9b33a661
#: ba219ed996fc4aee92e52c559fb38b60
msgid "This pin is directly connected to the ADC on the PX4FMU."
msgstr "此引脚直接连接到 PX4FMU 的 ADC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:131
#: a06f6566979b49bb86c5dccd085a6aef
msgid ""
"This pin can accept up to 6.6 volts (it has an internal voltage divider with"
" 2:1 scaling)."
msgstr "此引脚最高可承受 6.6V（内置 2:1 分压器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:134
#: 8735e821880442eeb98913d20871bf8d
msgid "**Pin 12** (Analog 2 input)"
msgstr "**引脚 12** （模拟 2 输入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:136
#: a6b82b54962941488e05b901648d627a
msgid "Located on pin 3 of the \"FMU-SPI\" port on the PX4IO board."
msgstr "位于 PX4IO 板上「FMU-SPI」接口的第 3 针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:137
#: 8faaf99d3f7e41cea66d2fe3852bbb65
msgid "Commonly used for Sonar"
msgstr "常用于声呐"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:139
#: 81ac5cc275a843a4ad5ae834b1498003
msgid "Copter and Rover Advanced Parameter: SONAR_PIN set to 12"
msgstr "Copter 和 Rover 高级参数：SONAR_PIN 设为 12"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:142
#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:152
#: 1ce0aeb041984beaa2b62f6c630fa3e0 b0bd961e5a894cde8985b03e896a6dac
msgid "This pin can accept up to 3.3 volts."
msgstr "此引脚最高可承受 3.3V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:144
#: f6c88640bd4f4fd5b3eb76499b3aff2d
msgid "**Pin 13** (Analog 3 input)"
msgstr "**引脚 13** （模拟 3 输入）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:146
#: e19da776074c4e1683f37db833721ca3
msgid "Located on pin 4 of the \"FMU-SPI\" port on the PX4IO board."
msgstr "位于 PX4IO 板上「FMU-SPI」接口的第 4 针。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:147
#: 5a20793d88cb4dcc89b07cc330e63935
msgid "Commonly used for Sonar 2 in dual Sonar installations."
msgstr "常用于双声呐安装中的声呐 2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:149
#: fd16473aa1ec4be9a28eabf78ae31804
msgid "Rover Advanced Parameter: SONAR2_PIN set to 13"
msgstr "Rover 高级参数：SONAR2_PIN 设为 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:154
#: 6ccb75450c6d412494025878469ab079
msgid ""
"**Pin 100** (Battery voltage measured on the power connector on the IO "
"board. Limit is 18V)."
msgstr "**引脚 100** （在 IO 板电源接口旁测量的电池电压，上限 18V）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:157
#: 615e610a8a544b8ab6a8a92948032801
msgid ""
"A virtual analog input pin for voltage of a battery connected to the 6V to "
"18V input of the PX4IO voltage regulator."
msgstr "连接到 PX4IO 电压调节器 6V 至 18V 输入的电池电压虚拟模拟输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:159
#: e1f7e5eafde146a49b662a105699d81a
msgid "This is the normal pin to use for LiPo monitoring on the PX4IO."
msgstr "这是在 PX4IO 上监测 LiPo 电压的常用引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:160
#: 8075f3f6b77343c0b6cb58aebc50719f
msgid ""
"If using this pin then set VOLT_DIVIDER to 1 for correct battery voltage "
"reading."
msgstr "使用此引脚时，请将 VOLT_DIVIDER 设为 1 以正确读取电池电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:162
#: ca2c72b36681438fbeddc88ce92d2c17
msgid ""
"Virtual \"pin\" 100's input comes only from the battery power in jack on the"
" PX4IO board."
msgstr "虚拟「引脚 100」的输入仅来自 PX4IO 板上的电池电源插座。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:164
#: 623e530b012741a9afd632b7790df323
msgid "This \"pin\" is not brought out for separate user access."
msgstr "此「引脚」未引出供用户单独访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:165
#: 809e6e44dc864da8b2990948eb5f96b3
msgid ""
"This pin is separate from the Pin 10 high voltage analog pin on the PX4FMU "
"listed above which can also be used as a battery voltage monitor."
msgstr "此引脚与上述 PX4FMU 上的引脚 10 高电压模拟引脚分开，后者也可用作电池电压监测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:169
#: af5d170e87bb4e54add354dcb19ee595
msgid ""
"**Pin 101**: Battery current measured on the pin next to the power connector"
" on the IO board."
msgstr "**引脚 101**：在 IO 板电源接口旁边引脚测量的电池电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:172
#: 3a00ac0ad43b4cea91d6a969e774871d
msgid ""
"A virtual analog input pin for a battery current sensor connected to the "
"\"current\" pin next to the power connector on the PX4IO."
msgstr "连接到 PX4IO 电源接口旁「current」引脚的电池电流传感器虚拟模拟输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:178
#: b0590622121b4f788a9c8607364a109f
msgid "You need to be careful"
msgstr "请注意"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:178
#: 5199064fdc3c4e8d9c3d2a7537bdee46
msgid ""
"to use a current sensor that will not provide over 3.3V as too high a "
"voltage on this pin can cause the PX4IO to reset."
msgstr "要使用不会超过 3.3V 输出的电流传感器，因为此引脚电压过高会导致 PX4IO 复位。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:181
#: f75e7c3393834089a9f00705f42d9901
msgid ""
"For use with a current sensor, a 0.1uF capacitor between this pin and ground"
" will help reduce \"noise\"."
msgstr "与电流传感器配合使用时，在此引脚与地之间连接 0.1uF 电容有助于减少「噪声」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:191
#: a556d71a9a8944abbcf92818c3d25e95
msgid "PX4v1 Digital outputs"
msgstr "PX4v1 数字输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:193
#: eb55bd5e571844309a09a3cd921c1646
msgid ""
"The PX4V1 digital output pins come in two types, one is pins that give 5V "
"when on and 0V when off, and the other are 'relay' pins which provide low "
"resistance when on and high resistance when off."
msgstr "PX4V1 数字输出引脚分两种类型：一种在开启时输出 5V、关闭时输出 0V；另一种为「继电器」引脚，开启时提供低阻抗、关闭时提供高阻抗。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-px4fmu-overview.rst:197
